                                                                                
 Usage: opentide setup ci [OPTIONS] {ci_platform}:<github|gitlab|azure>         
                                                                                
 Generate CI/CD pipeline files (platforms discovered from repo config).         
                                                                                
╭─ Arguments ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ *    ci_platform      <github|gitlab|azure>  github, gitlab, or azure        │
│                                              [required]                      │
╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯
╭─ Options ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ --path              -C                         <str>  Repository path        │
│                                                       [default: .]           │
│ --staging               --no-staging                  Deploy to staging      │
│                                                       tenants from pull      │
│                                                       requests               │
│                                                       [default: staging]     │
│ --inflight              --no-inflight                 Update                 │
│                                                       .opentide/inflight/    │
│                                                       preview shards on pull │
│                                                       requests               │
│                                                       [default: inflight]    │
│ --sharing               --no-sharing                  Share changed objects  │
│                                                       on the default branch  │
│                                                       (off unless selected)  │
│                                                       [default: no-sharing]  │
│ --lint-changed          --lint-all                    Gate lint on the       │
│                                                       object files each run  │
│                                                       changes, so a          │
│                                                       catalogue with         │
│                                                       inherited findings can │
│                                                       adopt it (validate     │
│                                                       still checks every     │
│                                                       file)                  │
│                                                       [default: lint-all]    │
│ --promotion             --no-promotion                Write [promotion]      │
│                                                       enabled in             │
│                                                       deployment.toml. Omit  │
│                                                       to keep the            │
│                                                       repository's setting.  │
│ --promotion-target                             <str>  Status deploy promotes │
│                                                       rules to. Omit to keep │
│                                                       the repository's       │
│                                                       setting.               │
│ --python-version                               <str>  Python version the     │
│                                                       pipeline installs      │
│                                                       [default: 3.12]        │
│ --explorer-pages        --no-explorer-pages           Include GitHub Pages   │
│                                                       explorer build and     │
│                                                       deploy jobs            │
│                                                       [default:              │
│                                                       no-explorer-pages]     │
│ --default-branch                               <str>  Branch that deploys    │
│                                                       and receives inflight  │
│                                                       shards (default:       │
│                                                       origin/HEAD, then the  │
│                                                       checked-out branch,    │
│                                                       then                   │
│                                                       init.defaultBranch,    │
│                                                       then main; GitLab uses │
│                                                       $CI_DEFAULT_BRANCH)    │
│ --plan                                                List the files each    │
│                                                       step would write, and  │
│                                                       write nothing          │
│ --yes               -y                                Write without asking   │
│                                                       for confirmation       │
│ --help                                                Show this message and  │
│                                                       exit.                  │
╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯

 Examples
   $ opentide setup ci github --yes
